here's what we would do for the film, here's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:30.720
the distribution fee,” and then either they have&nbsp;
a a term sheet or they just type it into an email.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.780
Usually the next step is I&nbsp;
present that to my filmmaker,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:46.080
explain the company to them and what they're&nbsp;
about, introduce them so they can hear from&nbsp;&nbsp;

