the horse's mouth so the distributor can tell them&nbsp;
exactly what they're going to do with the film and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:58.200
how much they like the film, etc. Then we repeat&nbsp;
that process with any other offers coming in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.560
and then I usually try to help the client make&nbsp;
a decision in terms of which way they want to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

