ever offer the lowest cap on expenses they'll do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:26.640
the lowest term they'll do and and then there&nbsp;
are some companies I know that they've come at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:30.840
me a little higher than what they'll do and&nbsp;
I know what the wiggle room is ahead of time&nbsp;&nbsp;

